---
description: Project version numbering and release lifecycle
alwaysApply: true
---

- Follow `docs/operations/version-policy.md` for all release work.
- Daily independent releases increment patch; milestone/major transitions require explicit confirmation of scope.
- Extend an existing draft; preserve published history. Legacy missing status means frozen history.
- Use `scripts/bump_release.py` to synchronize metadata. Document-only changes do not bump versions.
- Distinguish draft preparation, release, and deployment verification; report only checks actually performed.
